From 562246746b1b812abd70c6f0517e78cbd10984b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Andrew J. Moore" <andrew@forevermoore.net>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:22:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 07/11] ws2_32: Implement NS_NLA network enumeration in
 WSALookupServiceW.

WSALookupServiceBeginW/NextW/End were stubs.  The Remote Desktop client
(mstscax.dll) enumerates the NLA namespace (NLA_SERVICE_CLASS_GUID) to
check network availability.  Report one network per operational,
non-loopback adapter with NLA_INTERFACE and NLA_CONNECTIVITY blob
entries, and validate parameters and handles as Windows does.
---
 dlls/ws2_32/protocol.c       | 274 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 dlls/ws2_32/tests/protocol.c |  68 ++++++++-
 2 files changed, 328 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dlls/ws2_32/protocol.c b/dlls/ws2_32/protocol.c
index c0add6b..6ae2bdd 100644
--- a/dlls/ws2_32/protocol.c
+++ b/dlls/ws2_32/protocol.c
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@
